---
description: Never wrap markdown link text in backticks
globs: "**/*.{md,mdx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Markdown link text

- NEVER: Put backticks inside markdown link brackets. The sequence `[`` must not appear in `.md` / `.mdx` files.
- MUST: Write plain link text. Code styling belongs on bare `` `code` `` spans outside links, not inside `[…](…)`.

```markdown
<!-- BAD -->
[`function`](/docs/sdk/methods/function)
[`microlink` binary](/docs/sdk/getting-started/cli)

<!-- GOOD -->
[function](/docs/sdk/methods/function)
[microlink binary](/docs/sdk/getting-started/cli)
```
